OL,3,ADemocrats win control of US Congress in
OL,4,Asweeping victory as voters reject
OL,5,ATrump's Republicans
OL,6,
OL,7,FMeanwhile, top Democrat in the House
OL,8,FHakeem Jeffries calls his party's
OL,9,Fvictory a "red, white and blue moment".
OL,10,FSome seats in the lower chamber are
OL,11,Fstill being counted - but the Democrats
OL,12,Fhave surpassed the 218 needed to win
OL,14,FHow will Trump deal with a Congress
OL,15,Fcontrolled by Democrats? A picture he
OL,16,Fposted on social media may give us a
OL,17,Fclue, writes our White House reporter
